 "from_the_game": "Not made here because the game already has them (assets/game/tex): roofs (roof_1 to roof_4), doors (door_1 to door_5), timber (wood), earth and mud (dirt_1 to dirt_3), the road surfaces. Stand-ins made here from what there is: iron (the dark smooth stone graded cold), rust iron (the rust rock), the Ossuary's wall (river cobbles graded ivory: stacked bone-ends at a distance; a true bone wall is modelling, chunk 4). Still to make in chunk 4: copings and arch stones (geometry), and soot, damp, moss, blood and rust streaks as a world-space layer over any wall."
